{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07611","headline":"途中晓发 · 崔曙","name":"途中晓发","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓霁长风里，劳歌赴远期。\n云轻归海疾，月满下山迟。\n旅望因高尽，乡心遇物悲。\n故林遥不见，况在落花时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07611.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07611","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、据《唐诗鉴赏辞典》（周啸天主编，商务印书馆国际有限公司，2012年1月版）「途中晓发」条，撰者星　汉、《全唐诗》（清·曹寅等编，康熙扬州诗局本）","citation":"星 汉"}